# tpm source list - one "name url" pair per line.
# '#' starts a comment; blank lines are ignored.
#
# Each url is a plain HTTP directory: "<url>/Packages" is the index
# (one "name version filename" line per package) and "<url>/<filename>"
# is the .tpkg itself.
#
# The official package repository is served from GitHub Pages, split
# into two directories: "tested", where every package has actually
# been installed and run with a real tpm in a booted TUS before being
# added, and "untested", where it hasn't. tpm warns before installing
# anything found under a repo whose url ends in "/untested".
tested   https://toasty-unix-software.github.io/packages/tested
untested https://toasty-unix-software.github.io/packages/untested
